{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id322214748"}, "name":{"label":"meaganalyssa"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-05-08T12:18:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.4"}, "id":{"label":"9906573765"}, "title":{"label":"Been using for years and it keeps getting better :)"}, "content":{"label":"Not much out there with this many functions and options! I need a good “nag” alert, repeatable alarms and lots of customizations, and it’s all and then some. In fact, I’m sure I’m missing a few handy things I just haven’t taken the time to discover!\n\nReally Due’s only downside is that it always reminds me of things I don’t want to do or feel like doing. I mean, I get so tired of all the adulting! Maybe the devs could put that higher on their priority list, along with world peace and whatnot. Thanks!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
