{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id158093909"}, "name":{"label":"brandonglennt"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-03-01T07:26:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.3"}, "id":{"label":"9668186528"}, "title":{"label":"Tried and True for Years"}, "content":{"label":"As a teacher and adult with responsibilities, this app has been a staple for my maximizing my productivity for years. From taking attendance to taking out the trash, this app keeps me on top of my game. The new critical alert capability is a dream! It has made an already great app absolute perfection.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1413577488"}, "name":{"label":"UnoDickles"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-02-28T01:29:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.3"}, "id":{"label":"9663752701"}, "title":{"label":"Saved me so many times"}, "content":{"label":"This app is exactly what I needed. I have so many reoccurring bills and payments and a hectic schedule that it gets hard to manage it all and I end up missing payments sometimes. This app lets me set how often it nags me about a specific reminder and I can thankfully set it to annoy me every month. I haven’t missed a bill since!!!\n\nSeriously a life saver! \n\nIt’s also super easy to use and is quick to making a reminder. I LOVE the widget ability that lets me see upcoming/current/overdue reminders. \n\nIf you need an app to nag you about things till you manually check it off, this is the one for you!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
