{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id222707220"}, "name":{"label":"This nickname isn't taken, yet"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-02-17T05:56:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.2"}, "id":{"label":"9626697091"}, "title":{"label":"sneaky thieflike app management"}, "content":{"label":"I had purchased the full verion of this app, had paid full price for this with the expectation that the full functionality advertised as part of the app would not one day suddenly disappear behind a paywall. But sure enough that has as of today just happened. Inexcusable. Really disappointed in this app's developers and whatever company personnel were involved in this underhanded decision.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id37945926"}, "name":{"label":"Speak4Truth"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-02-10T19:34:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.2"}, "id":{"label":"9605022655"}, "title":{"label":"Was Great"}, "content":{"label":"I have notifications set to only show within Notification Center on iPhone but no way to stop them from popping up on my Apple Watch! Even uninstalling the app from the watch does not stop the notifications from popping up! I looked in settings, etc and there’s no way to prevent them. This must be a bug. Please fix!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id689006216"}, "name":{"label":"Marbarrrrrr"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-02-10T10:55:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.2"}, "id":{"label":"9603814118"}, "title":{"label":"Great App!!"}, "content":{"label":"Revising my previous rating about dark mode being taken away after I purchased it. It was a bug which the team at Due has fixed 😀", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id438921594"}, "name":{"label":"Monsieur Reasonable"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-02-10T07:57:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.2"}, "id":{"label":"9603329999"}, "title":{"label":"This app is really top quality and probably the best of its kind"}, "content":{"label":"This app is really top quality and probably the best of its kind — with two easy changes I would give this app 5 stars. If it allowed a back up that could be imported to restore all the reminders into the app rather than just a text file, and if it let you choose more friendly colors that ack and white — like and earthtone green and/or other more pleasant colors. That said this app lets you set reminders and makes it as easy and seamless as possible— it also lets you add alarms to your reminders and the small price for it all is very much worth it, and they don’t charge you a subscription like some apps so you get what you pay for — you can get future features after a year with a subscription which seems reasonable to help them develop for it, but it being unlocked once you buy it is important. There’s a lot of other details I haven’t mentioned here, but definitely just try the app out for a bit and see what you think of it\n\nEdit: The developers responded to this post about how to back up data, which I appreciate — that said I would like to be able to back up my data locally to be restored later locally on my computer or elsewhere as I prefer to keep my data off the cloud. If this can be added it would be greatly appreciated and I would update this review", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id135934647"}, "name":{"label":"yeahthisismynickname"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-02-10T07:23:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.2"}, "id":{"label":"9603229521"}, "title":{"label":"This app would have received a 5-Star review if…"}, "content":{"label":"UPDATE:\nThe developer responded to my complaint, and corrected the bug. I now have everything unlocked again! I updated my rating to 5 stars, because as I mentioned below, this is an incredible app!! Tons of thanks to the developer!!! \n\nThey had been honest from the get go. Signing up you’re given the impression that whatever you have access to upon purchasing, you will maintain after the first year’s subscription(included in the initial purchase) is expired, EXCEPT for the new features. I’m here to tell you this is a lie. Just a moment ago, apparently one year later exactly TO THE MINUTE, I noticed my widget for this app no longer works, and I must pay the annual premium to be able to use its widgets. I now regret recommending this app to the dozens of people that I have, I feel as though I’ve misled them in some way. I see that the developer reads this stuff. This app has literally been a lifesaver, and I will continue to use it because it’s helped me manage my ADHD so well. But the lack of integrity and transparency upon the purchase is really disheartening. I’m still giving it 3 stars, as opposed to the 1 I almost gave it, because it truly is an incredible app, and has helped me have a more organized life.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
