{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id28149995"}, "name":{"label":"Skip108"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-01-30T08:39:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.1"}, "id":{"label":"9564341075"}, "title":{"label":"This app is simply perfect"}, "content":{"label":"No hyperbole here. My standards are fairly high — and this app checks every box for me. It works perfectly, it’s ergonomic, it looks great, and the development team is best-in-class, with the snappiest,  most thoughtful and responsive update cycle I’ve ever seen from an app developer. Even their business model is great — hybrid own/subscribe, at a very reasonable price. \n\nThis app really complements all your other reminder/scheduling apps — filling the niche for both single and recurring tasks that are important enough to merit recurrent, insistent reminders.  This is one of my all-time essential apps.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
