{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id37974406"}, "name":{"label":"Macgenie"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-01-25T07:37:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.1"}, "id":{"label":"9546014459"}, "title":{"label":"Simple yet powerful indispensable tool"}, "content":{"label":"This app is at the foundation of my system of managing tasks. I have used Due for so many years now, and I can’t believe I’ve never left a review. I have used many task managers over the years, but Due is where I put things that have to be done and not forgotten. It is easy to enter reminders and very convenient to mark them done or postpone them. Solid app with an active developer.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id596724822"}, "name":{"label":"JamesFMann"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-01-25T06:48:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.1"}, "id":{"label":"9545865420"}, "title":{"label":"Exactly what my brain needs to be organized"}, "content":{"label":"I really like that I can dump everything I need to complete and then snooze it until I can do it. It’s how my brain works, and this fits the bill. Feature request: It would be nice if these items were able to be on the calendar and in view there, instead of the app and it still like me have all the customized snooze options, but I can live without for now. Nice work though! Keep it up!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
